doc:sec-10-112-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "10(1) 04  Application of section 46 in relation to conference agreements" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of section 46, if the parties to a conference agreement together have a substantial degree of power in a market in which any party to the agreement provides international liner cargo shipping services under the agreement, each party to the conference agreement shall be taken to have a substantial degree of power in the market." ;
    cof:pageNumber "44"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-112-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10(2) 04  Application of section 46 in relation to conference agreements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-112-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) In subsection (1): conference agreement means an agreement between members of a conference in relation to international liner cargo shipping services provided, or proposed to be provided, by them, and includes an agreement that varies such an agreement.  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Minimum standards for conference agreements  Division 3  Section 10.06  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(2) In subsection (1): conference agreement means an agreement between members of a conference in relation to international liner cargo shipping services provided, or proposed to be provided, by them, and includes an agreement that varies such an agreement.  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Minimum standards for conference agreements  Division 3  Section 10.06  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "95e14c8340b3914f88a0ac93ccd4a779c740dce52672ea71694b5382bd4a9919" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-112 ;
    cof:pageNumber "44"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines conference agreement" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
