concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-116 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 09  Where may consequences of conference agreements not"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-116 ;
    values:originalText "complying with minimum standards be found?  The consequences of a conference agreement not complying with this Division are to be found in the following provisions:  (a) section 10.28 (decision on application for provisional registration);  (b) section 10.33 (decision on application for final registration);  (c) section 10.45 (circumstances in which Minister may exercise powers in relation to registered conference agreements).  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "complying with minimum standards be found?  The consequences of a conference agreement not complying with this Division are to be found in the following provisions:  (a) section 10.28 (decision on application for provisional registration);  (b) section 10.33 (decision on application for final registration);  (c) section 10.45 (circumstances in which Minister may exercise powers in relation to registered conference agreements).  Chapter 6  Other provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "976d17621e8da3175057b5fc832d87518d29e907d2d051ea4011b369c6a7c4a8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "47"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "References other provisions for consequences of non-compliance with minimum standards." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.47" ;
