concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-118 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 11  What registers are to be kept by the Registrar?"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-118 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Registrar shall keep:  (a) a register of conference agreements; and  (b) a register of designated shipper bodies; and  (c) a register of non-conference ocean carriers with substantial market power; and  (d) a register of obligations concerning unfair pricing practices; and  (e) a register of ocean carrier agents; and  (f) a register of exemption orders.  (2) An entry in a register must contain such particulars as are prescribed in relation to the register." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Registrar shall keep:  (a) a register of conference agreements; and  (b) a register of designated shipper bodies; and  (c) a register of non-conference ocean carriers with substantial market power; and  (d) a register of obligations concerning unfair pricing practices; and  (e) a register of ocean carrier agents; and  (f) a register of exemption orders.  (2) An entry in a register must contain such particulars as are prescribed in relation to the register."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a90488a23eaaee736b21bdfa369fe7aeaee21a7932a45ce2dcf8f28c3b0fff03" ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-118-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-118-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
