concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-119 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 12  What conference agreement files are to be kept by the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-119 ;
    values:originalText "Registrar?  (1) The Registrar shall keep a file, to be known as the conference agreement file, for each conference agreement (other than a varying conference agreement).  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Registers and files and public inspection of them  Division 4  Section 10.13  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) The conference agreement file for a conference agreement must include:  (a) documents filed with the Registrar under Division 6 in relation to the agreement or any relevant varying conference agreement (other than any part of a document that is not open to public inspection);  (b) abstracts accepted by the Registrar under section 10.36 in relation to such documents (being abstracts of those parts of the documents that are not open to public inspection); and  (c) notifications given to the Registrar under subsection 10.40(1) or 10.43(1) in relation to the agreement or any relevant varying conference agreement." ;
    skos:definition "Registrar?  (1) The Registrar shall keep a file, to be known as the conference agreement file, for each conference agreement (other than a varying conference agreement).  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Registers and files and public inspection of them  Division 4  Section 10.13  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) The conference agreement file for a conference agreement must include:  (a) documents filed with the Registrar under Division 6 in relation to the agreement or any relevant varying conference agreement (other than any part of a document that is not open to public inspection);  (b) abstracts accepted by the Registrar under section 10.36 in relation to such documents (being abstracts of those parts of the documents that are not open to public inspection); and  (c) notifications given to the Registrar under subsection 10.40(1) or 10.43(1) in relation to the agreement or any relevant varying conference agreement."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2b805130249500cac20c42351da000c6f4b41b05e3f0a7b2cf0f71cf76cb9305" ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-119-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-119-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.48" .
doc:sec-10-119 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "10 12  What conference agreement files are to be kept by the" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Registrar?  (1) The Registrar shall keep a file, to be known as the conference agreement file, for each conference agreement (other than a varying conference agreement).  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Registers and files and public inspection of them  Division 4  Section 10.13  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) The conference agreement file for a conference agreement must include:  (a) documents filed with the Registrar under Division 6 in relation to the agreement or any relevant varying conference agreement (other than any part of a document that is not open to public inspection);  (b) abstracts accepted by the Registrar under section 10.36 in relation to such documents (being abstracts of those parts of the documents that are not open to public inspection); and  (c) notifications given to the Registrar under subsection 10.40(1) or 10.43(1) in relation to the agreement or any relevant varying conference agreement." ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer .

