doc:sec-10-119-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "10(1) 12  What conference agreement files are to be kept by the" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Registrar shall keep a file, to be known as the conference agreement file, for each conference agreement (other than a varying conference agreement).  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Registers and files and public inspection of them  Division 4  Section 10.13  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-119-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10(2) 12  What conference agreement files are to be kept by the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-119-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The conference agreement file for a conference agreement must include:  (a) documents filed with the Registrar under Division 6 in relation to the agreement or any relevant varying conference agreement (other than any part of a document that is not open to public inspection);  (b) abstracts accepted by the Registrar under section 10.36 in relation to such documents (being abstracts of those parts of the documents that are not open to public inspection); and  (c) notifications given to the Registrar under subsection 10.40(1) or 10.43(1) in relation to the agreement or any relevant varying conference agreement." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The conference agreement file for a conference agreement must include:  (a) documents filed with the Registrar under Division 6 in relation to the agreement or any relevant varying conference agreement (other than any part of a document that is not open to public inspection);  (b) abstracts accepted by the Registrar under section 10.36 in relation to such documents (being abstracts of those parts of the documents that are not open to public inspection); and  (c) notifications given to the Registrar under subsection 10.40(1) or 10.43(1) in relation to the agreement or any relevant varying conference agreement."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fb1b0d010c6e3bc850c66d3c59a31c4281ef28595b6ec89e15280d9da5942104" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-119 ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Conference agreement file must include specific documents and notifications." ;
