    values:originalText "(3) Sections 45AG, 45AK and 45 do not apply to conduct engaged in by a party to a freight rate agreement, so far as the conduct gives effect to freight rate charges in the freight rate agreement, if:  (a) the freight rates (including base freight rates, surcharges, rebates and allowances) specified in the freight rate agreement are for outwards liner cargo shipping services  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Exemptions from certain restrictive trade practice prohibitions  Division 5  Section 10.18  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  provided under a single registered outwards conference agreement after the end of 30 days after the last-mentioned agreement is finally registered; and  (b) the parties to the freight rate agreement are the same as the parties to the registered outwards conference agreement." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Sections 45AG, 45AK and 45 do not apply to conduct engaged in by a party to a freight rate agreement, so far as the conduct gives effect to freight rate charges in the freight rate agreement, if:  (a) the freight rates (including base freight rates, surcharges, rebates and allowances) specified in the freight rate agreement are for outwards liner cargo shipping services  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Exemptions from certain restrictive trade practice prohibitions  Division 5  Section 10.18  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  provided under a single registered outwards conference agreement after the end of 30 days after the last-mentioned agreement is finally registered; and  (b) the parties to the freight rate agreement are the same as the parties to the registered outwards conference agreement."@en ;
