concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-128 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 19  Exemptions from sections 45AF, 45AG, 45AJ, 45AK and 45"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-128 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Sections 45AF, 45AJ and 45 do not apply in relation to the making of a contract or arrangement, or the arriving at an understanding, if the contract, arrangement or understanding is a loyalty agreement.  (2) Sections 45AG, 45AK and 45 do not apply in relation to conduct engaged in by a party to a loyalty agreement so far as the conduct  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Exemptions from certain restrictive trade practice prohibitions  Division 5  Section 10.20  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  gives effect to a provision of the agreement in relation to an outwards liner cargo shipping service or an inwards liner cargo shipping service." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Sections 45AF, 45AJ and 45 do not apply in relation to the making of a contract or arrangement, or the arriving at an understanding, if the contract, arrangement or understanding is a loyalty agreement.  (2) Sections 45AG, 45AK and 45 do not apply in relation to conduct engaged in by a party to a loyalty agreement so far as the conduct  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Exemptions from certain restrictive trade practice prohibitions  Division 5  Section 10.20  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  gives effect to a provision of the agreement in relation to an outwards liner cargo shipping service or an inwards liner cargo shipping service."@en ;
