concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-130 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 21  Exemptions cease to apply in relation to a shipper at the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-130 ;
    values:originalText "shipper’s option  The exemptions provided by this Subdivision in relation to the operation of a loyalty agreement cease to apply in relation to conduct engaged in by an ocean carrier in relation to a shipper if the shipper notifies, as prescribed, the Commission and each ocean carrier who is a party to the agreement that the shipper no longer wishes the exemptions to apply. Subdivision D—Other exemptions" ;
    skos:definition "shipper’s option  The exemptions provided by this Subdivision in relation to the operation of a loyalty agreement cease to apply in relation to conduct engaged in by an ocean carrier in relation to a shipper if the shipper notifies, as prescribed, the Commission and each ocean carrier who is a party to the agreement that the shipper no longer wishes the exemptions to apply. Subdivision D—Other exemptions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "be507d46f0522b5e5369824fde107dae48ef512b113dbe61ddfdd60ca0419c2a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "55"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Shipper can notify Commission and carriers to cease exemptions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.55" ;
    cml:asserts concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-130-norm .
