concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-131 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 24  Exemptions from sections 45AF, 45AG, 45AJ, 45AK, 45 and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-131 ;
    values:originalText "47 in relation to certain negotiations  (1) Sections 45AF, 45AJ, 45 and 47 do not apply in relation to conduct engaged in by an ocean carrier, conference, shipper or designated shipper body so far as the conduct relates to the determination of terms and conditions of loyalty agreements.  (2) Sections 45AF, 45AG, 45AJ, 45AK, 45 and 47 do not apply in relation to conduct engaged in by an ocean carrier, conference, shipper or designated shipper body so far as the conduct relates to  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "47 in relation to certain negotiations  (1) Sections 45AF, 45AJ, 45 and 47 do not apply in relation to conduct engaged in by an ocean carrier, conference, shipper or designated shipper body so far as the conduct relates to the determination of terms and conditions of loyalty agreements.  (2) Sections 45AF, 45AG, 45AJ, 45AK, 45 and 47 do not apply in relation to conduct engaged in by an ocean carrier, conference, shipper or designated shipper body so far as the conduct relates to  Chapter 6  Other provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7aa80c495d8b57cb9e2c18bd8b29ceb818675a71e3ee026bbc88ee81e7df118c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "55"^^xsd:integer ;
