    values:originalText "(5) In this section:  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Exemptions from certain restrictive trade practice prohibitions  Division 5  Section 10.24A  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  stevedoring contract means a contract between:  (a) an ocean carrier; and  (b) a stevedoring operator; under which the stevedoring operator provides, or arranges for the provision of, stevedoring services to the ocean carrier in connection with cargo transported on international liner cargo shipping services provided by the ocean carrier. stevedoring operator means a person who:  (a) provides, or proposes to provide; or  (b) arranges for the provision of, or proposes to arrange for the provision of; stevedoring services in connection with cargo transported on international liner cargo shipping services.  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "(5) In this section:  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Exemptions from certain restrictive trade practice prohibitions  Division 5  Section 10.24A  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  stevedoring contract means a contract between:  (a) an ocean carrier; and  (b) a stevedoring operator; under which the stevedoring operator provides, or arranges for the provision of, stevedoring services to the ocean carrier in connection with cargo transported on international liner cargo shipping services provided by the ocean carrier. stevedoring operator means a person who:  (a) provides, or proposes to provide; or  (b) arranges for the provision of, or proposes to arrange for the provision of; stevedoring services in connection with cargo transported on international liner cargo shipping services.  Chapter 6  Other provisions"@en ;
