concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-136 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 27A  Copy of conference agreement to be given to designated peak"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-136 ;
    values:originalText "shipper body  (1) If:  (a) the parties to an outwards conference agreement apply for its provisional registration; and  (b) at the time of the application, there is a designated outwards peak shipper body; the parties must give the designated outwards peak shipper body a copy of:  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "shipper body  (1) If:  (a) the parties to an outwards conference agreement apply for its provisional registration; and  (b) at the time of the application, there is a designated outwards peak shipper body; the parties must give the designated outwards peak shipper body a copy of:  Chapter 6  Other provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6dd408a61ec13f92581d42ee574f1e0095b22bd086efc2d3205f4a321266b22b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "59"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must provide copy of conference agreement to designated peak shipper body." ;
    dc:description "true" ;
