concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-141 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 Section 10"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-141 ;
    values:originalText "32  Copy of agreement to be filed with application etc.  (1) Subject to subsections (1A) and (1B), an application for the final registration of a conference agreement must be accompanied by:  (a) a complete copy of the agreement so far as it is in writing (including all provisions of the agreement so far as they are in writing); and  (b) a written memorandum that fully sets out the agreement so far as it is not in writing (including all provisions of the agreement so far as they are not in writing).  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Registration of conference agreements  Division 6  Section 10.33  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (1A) The copy of the agreement referred to in paragraph (1)(a) need not include the freight rate charges in the agreement.  (1B) The written memorandum referred to in paragraph (1)(b) need not include the freight rate charges in the agreement.  (2) A document that accompanies an application for the final registration of a conference agreement must comply with any regulations requiring its verification (in whole or part) by or on behalf of the applicants." ;
    skos:definition "32  Copy of agreement to be filed with application etc.  (1) Subject to subsections (1A) and (1B), an application for the final registration of a conference agreement must be accompanied by:  (a) a complete copy of the agreement so far as it is in writing (including all provisions of the agreement so far as they are in writing); and  (b) a written memorandum that fully sets out the agreement so far as it is not in writing (including all provisions of the agreement so far as they are not in writing).  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Registration of conference agreements  Division 6  Section 10.33  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (1A) The copy of the agreement referred to in paragraph (1)(a) need not include the freight rate charges in the agreement.  (1B) The written memorandum referred to in paragraph (1)(b) need not include the freight rate charges in the agreement.  (2) A document that accompanies an application for the final registration of a conference agreement must comply with any regulations requiring its verification (in whole or part) by or on behalf of the applicants."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "966b9dbd0c4efcffa548c27800222f770931b24d54c21c5a2ba1e2613695397f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-141-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-141-ss-1a ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-141-ss-1b ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-141-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.64" .
