doc:sec-10-144-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "10(2) 35  Abstract to accompany request for confidentiality" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The abstract must:  (a) be in the appropriate prescribed form; and  (b) comply with any regulations requiring its verification (in whole or part) by or on behalf of the applicants." ;
    cof:pageNumber "67"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-145 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 36  Examination of abstract"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-145 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Where:  (a) a request is properly made under section 10.34 that a part of a document not be open to public inspection under this Part; and  (b) the request is accompanied by an abstract of the part of the document; the Registrar shall first determine whether to accept the abstract.  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Where:  (a) a request is properly made under section 10.34 that a part of a document not be open to public inspection under this Part; and  (b) the request is accompanied by an abstract of the part of the document; the Registrar shall first determine whether to accept the abstract.  Chapter 6  Other provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4fe2fb634afdca1e69c84e55a38ae3c0c3c3a1937ade9ea315573957398bf8b3" ;
