doc:sec-10-145 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "10 36  Examination of abstract" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Where:  (a) a request is properly made under section 10.34 that a part of a document not be open to public inspection under this Part; and  (b) the request is accompanied by an abstract of the part of the document; the Registrar shall first determine whether to accept the abstract.  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
