concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-147 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 38  Application for registration to be returned where request for"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-147 ;
    values:originalText "confidentiality refused etc. Where:  (a) an application for the provisional or final registration of a conference agreement includes a request under section 10.34 that a part of a document not be open to public inspection under this Part; and  (b) the request is refused by the Registrar; the Registrar shall also refuse the application, and shall return the application, and any documents that accompanied the application, to the applicants. Subdivision D—Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "confidentiality refused etc. Where:  (a) an application for the provisional or final registration of a conference agreement includes a request under section 10.34 that a part of a document not be open to public inspection under this Part; and  (b) the request is refused by the Registrar; the Registrar shall also refuse the application, and shall return the application, and any documents that accompanied the application, to the applicants. Subdivision D—Miscellaneous"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e1ef1a842cf9e480c31e8c2dff8534b5fb62de4e494889b42fdef0a61862d362" ;
