doc:sec-10-147 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "10 38  Application for registration to be returned where request for" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "confidentiality refused etc. Where:  (a) an application for the provisional or final registration of a conference agreement includes a request under section 10.34 that a part of a document not be open to public inspection under this Part; and  (b) the request is refused by the Registrar; the Registrar shall also refuse the application, and shall return the application, and any documents that accompanied the application, to the applicants. Subdivision D—Miscellaneous" ;
    cof:pageNumber "69"^^xsd:integer .

