    cof:title "10(8) 44  Powers exercisable by Minister in relation to registered" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(8) If:  (a) the Commission reports to the Minister under section 10.47 or 10.48 in relation to either or both of the matters referred to in subparagraphs 10.45(1)(a)(viii) and (ix); and  (b) after taking the report into account, the Minister is satisfied of either or both of those matters and decides to give a direction under subsection (1); the Minister must:  (c) prepare a statement about the decision; and  (d) cause:  (i) a copy of the statement; and  (ii) a copy of the Commission’s report;  to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 15 sittings days of that House after the decision was made." ;
    cof:pageNumber "76"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-154 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 45  Circumstances in which Minister may exercise powers in"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-154 ;
    values:originalText "relation to registered conference agreements  (1) The Minister shall not give a direction under subsection 10.44(1) in relation to a registered conference agreement unless:  (a) the Minister is satisfied of one or more of the following matters:  (i) in the case of an outwards conference agreement—that the agreement does not comply with section 10.06 (application of Australian law to outwards conference agreements and withdrawal from agreements);  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "relation to registered conference agreements  (1) The Minister shall not give a direction under subsection 10.44(1) in relation to a registered conference agreement unless:  (a) the Minister is satisfied of one or more of the following matters:  (i) in the case of an outwards conference agreement—that the agreement does not comply with section 10.06 (application of Australian law to outwards conference agreements and withdrawal from agreements);  Chapter 6  Other provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "966ae1f3546016b8dde03bcf2b33699b603bb576c7f7abb0bbad610d74d519cd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "77"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Minister cannot give direction under subsection 10.44(1) in relation to a registered conference agreement unless certain conditions are met." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.77" ;
    cml:asserts concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-154-norm .
