concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-158-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10(6) 49  Undertakings by parties to registered conference agreement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-158-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) On the inclusion of the notation, Subdivision A of Division 5 applies in relation to the agreement to the extent to which it would have applied but for the entry of the particulars of the direction." ;
