    skos:prefLabel "10 49A  Enforcement of undertakings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-159 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A party to a registered conference agreement must not contravene an undertaking given under section 10.49.  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Powers of Minister in relation to registered conference agreements  Division 8  Section 10.49A  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) Part VI applies in relation to subsection (1) as if that subsection were a provision of Part IV (but not of Division 1A of Part IV).  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A party to a registered conference agreement must not contravene an undertaking given under section 10.49.  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X Powers of Minister in relation to registered conference agreements  Division 8  Section 10.49A  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) Part VI applies in relation to subsection (1) as if that subsection were a provision of Part IV (but not of Division 1A of Part IV).  Chapter 6  Other provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "524763c787f59118b2a62cd185b064694e448bddfb2ede08666f18952bde8d11" ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer ;
