concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-171 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 61  Powers exercisable by Minister in relation to pricing practices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-171 ;
    values:originalText "etc.  (1) Subject to section 10.62, the Minister may, by writing served on an ocean carrier, order the ocean carrier not to engage in a pricing practice.  (2) Where the Minister makes an order under subsection (1), the Registrar shall immediately enter particulars of the order in the register of obligations concerning unfair pricing practices." ;
    skos:definition "etc.  (1) Subject to section 10.62, the Minister may, by writing served on an ocean carrier, order the ocean carrier not to engage in a pricing practice.  (2) Where the Minister makes an order under subsection (1), the Registrar shall immediately enter particulars of the order in the register of obligations concerning unfair pricing practices."@en ;
