concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-176 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 66  Determination of normal freight rates for shipping services"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-176 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The normal freight rates for outwards liner cargo shipping services or inwards liner cargo shipping services provided on a trade route are, subject to subsection (2), the freight rates actually charged in the ordinary course of shipping business for the same or similar services on the same or a comparable trade route by ocean carriers  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The normal freight rates for outwards liner cargo shipping services or inwards liner cargo shipping services provided on a trade route are, subject to subsection (2), the freight rates actually charged in the ordinary course of shipping business for the same or similar services on the same or a comparable trade route by ocean carriers  Chapter 6  Other provisions"@en ;
