doc:sec-10-176 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "10 66  Determination of normal freight rates for shipping services" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The normal freight rates for outwards liner cargo shipping services or inwards liner cargo shipping services provided on a trade route are, subject to subsection (2), the freight rates actually charged in the ordinary course of shipping business for the same or similar services on the same or a comparable trade route by ocean carriers  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
