    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-183-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of this section, each of the following provisions is an eligible regulatory provision:  (a) subsection 10.07(2);  (b) section 10.08;  (c) paragraph 10.28(1)(ba);  (d) subsection 10.29(1A);  (e) section 10.40;  (f) section 10.41;  (g) section 10.43;  (h) subparagraph 10.45(1)(a)(iv);  (i) subsection 10.45(3);  (j) subsection 10.45(4);  (k) section 10.52;  (l) subparagraph 10.62(a)(i).  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "(4) For the purposes of this section, each of the following provisions is an eligible regulatory provision:  (a) subsection 10.07(2);  (b) section 10.08;  (c) paragraph 10.28(1)(ba);  (d) subsection 10.29(1A);  (e) section 10.40;  (f) section 10.41;  (g) section 10.43;  (h) subparagraph 10.45(1)(a)(iv);  (i) subsection 10.45(3);  (j) subsection 10.45(4);  (k) section 10.52;  (l) subparagraph 10.62(a)(i).  Chapter 6  Other provisions"@en ;
