    values:originalText "An exemption order may be expressed to be subject to such conditions as are specified in the order.  Other provisions  Chapter 6 International liner cargo shipping  Part X General provisions relating to registers and conference agreement files  Division 13  Section 10.73  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
