concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-190 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 76  Correction of clerical errors and other mistakes in certain"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-190 ;
    values:originalText "registers etc.  Where the Registrar is satisfied that a clerical error or other mistake exists in particulars entered in a register kept by the Registrar or that matters included in particulars entered in a register kept by the Registrar are obsolete, the Registrar may vary the particulars for the purpose of correcting the error or mistake or removing the obsolete matters.  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "registers etc.  Where the Registrar is satisfied that a clerical error or other mistake exists in particulars entered in a register kept by the Registrar or that matters included in particulars entered in a register kept by the Registrar are obsolete, the Registrar may vary the particulars for the purpose of correcting the error or mistake or removing the obsolete matters.  Chapter 6  Other provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9409d295d808581d9ec12a1bfbb3705ae669c0397afb5c6905f31e2b465346a2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "105"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Registrar may correct clerical errors or mistakes in registers." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
