concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-200 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 82D  Review by Tribunal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-200 ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this section, each of the following decisions of the Minister is a reviewable decision:  (a) a decision to:  (i) give; or  (ii) refuse to give;  a direction under subsection 10.44(1), subsection 10.46(3), paragraph 10.49(3)(b), subsection 10.51(1), subsection 10.56(3) or paragraph 10.59(3)(b);  (b) a decision under section 10.49, 10.59 or 10.64 to:  (i) accept an offer; or  (ii) refuse to accept an offer;  (c) a decision under paragraph 10.49(3)(a), 10.59(3)(a) or" ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this section, each of the following decisions of the Minister is a reviewable decision:  (a) a decision to:  (i) give; or  (ii) refuse to give;  a direction under subsection 10.44(1), subsection 10.46(3), paragraph 10.49(3)(b), subsection 10.51(1), subsection 10.56(3) or paragraph 10.59(3)(b);  (b) a decision under section 10.49, 10.59 or 10.64 to:  (i) accept an offer; or  (ii) refuse to accept an offer;  (c) a decision under paragraph 10.49(3)(a), 10.59(3)(a) or"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6580f187f22b7955fb45c3c62d156cbe15f8220973410201b7f590aa55f0d6cf" ;
    cof:pageNumber "110"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "List of reviewable decisions by Minister" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.110" ;
