concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-10-213-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10(5) 89  Disclosure of confidential information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-213-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Subsection (4) applies in relation to the divulging or communicating of information whether directly or indirectly, but does not apply in relation to the divulging or communicating of information to, or the giving of a part of a document to, the Minister." ;
