concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-132b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "132B Commonwealth Minister to be notified if no person wishes a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-132b ;
    values:originalText "conference to be held  (1) If no person notifies the Commission in accordance with a proposed ban notice, or a proposed recall notice, that the person wishes the Commission to hold a conference, the Commission must, in writing, notify the Commonwealth Minister of that fact.  (2) A notice under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument." ;
    skos:definition "conference to be held  (1) If no person notifies the Commission in accordance with a proposed ban notice, or a proposed recall notice, that the person wishes the Commission to hold a conference, the Commission must, in writing, notify the Commonwealth Minister of that fact.  (2) A notice under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument."@en ;
