concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "133E Self-incrimination"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-133e ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person is not excused from:  (a) giving information or evidence; or  (b) producing a document; as required by a disclosure notice given to the person on the ground that the information or evidence, or production of the document, might tend to incriminate the person or expose the person to a penalty.  Other provisions  Chapter 6 Application of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of the Commonwealth  Part XI Enforcement  Division 4  Section 133F  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) However, in the case of an individual:  (a) the information or evidence given, or the document produced; and  (b) giving the information or evidence, or producing the document; are not admissible in evidence against the individual:  (c) in any proceedings instituted by the individual; or  (d) in any criminal proceedings, other than proceedings against the individual for an offence against section 133F or 133G." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person is not excused from:  (a) giving information or evidence; or  (b) producing a document; as required by a disclosure notice given to the person on the ground that the information or evidence, or production of the document, might tend to incriminate the person or expose the person to a penalty.  Other provisions  Chapter 6 Application of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of the Commonwealth  Part XI Enforcement  Division 4  Section 133F  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) However, in the case of an individual:  (a) the information or evidence given, or the document produced; and  (b) giving the information or evidence, or producing the document; are not admissible in evidence against the individual:  (c) in any proceedings instituted by the individual; or  (d) in any criminal proceedings, other than proceedings against the individual for an offence against section 133F or 133G."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "12be0567a85da4b8d2a08aed22281578900f162c3f7089d2d5ee70ba8b3e8358" ;
    cof:pageNumber "140"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133e-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133e-ss-2 ;
