    values:originalText "(2) The court may make an order under subsection (1) authorising one or more inspectors to do the following in accordance with any requirements specified in the order:  (a) to enter the premises of the person that are specified in the order;  (b) to search the premises for consumer goods of a kind specified in the order;  Other provisions  Chapter 6 Application of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of the Commonwealth  Part XI Enforcement  Division 4  Section 133J  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (c) to seize any such consumer goods that are found at those premises;  (d) to destroy or otherwise dispose of any such consumer goods that are so seized." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The court may make an order under subsection (1) authorising one or more inspectors to do the following in accordance with any requirements specified in the order:  (a) to enter the premises of the person that are specified in the order;  (b) to search the premises for consumer goods of a kind specified in the order;  Other provisions  Chapter 6 Application of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of the Commonwealth  Part XI Enforcement  Division 4  Section 133J  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (c) to seize any such consumer goods that are found at those premises;  (d) to destroy or otherwise dispose of any such consumer goods that are so seized."@en ;
