concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133j a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "133J Recovery of reasonable costs of seizing, and destroying or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-133j ;
    values:originalText "disposing of, consumer goods  (1) If an inspector seizes, and destroys or otherwise disposes of, consumer goods in accordance with an order made under subsection 133H(1):  (a) the person from whom the consumer goods were seized; or  (b) if that person is not entitled to possess the consumer goods— the owner of the consumer goods; is liable to pay an amount equal to the costs reasonably incurred by the inspector in seizing, and in destroying or disposing of, the consumer goods.  (2) An amount payable by a person under subsection (1):  (a) is a debt due by the person to the Commonwealth; and  (b) may be recovered by action in a court of competent jurisdiction.  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "disposing of, consumer goods  (1) If an inspector seizes, and destroys or otherwise disposes of, consumer goods in accordance with an order made under subsection 133H(1):  (a) the person from whom the consumer goods were seized; or  (b) if that person is not entitled to possess the consumer goods— the owner of the consumer goods; is liable to pay an amount equal to the costs reasonably incurred by the inspector in seizing, and in destroying or disposing of, the consumer goods.  (2) An amount payable by a person under subsection (1):  (a) is a debt due by the person to the Commonwealth; and  (b) may be recovered by action in a court of competent jurisdiction.  Chapter 6  Other provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0d5874930d9cb3dc52eddedde94f482ae50230c66225e474bcd317edd6962abe" ;
    cof:pageNumber "143"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133j-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-133j-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.143" .
