    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-134-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) This Division does not:  (a) require an infringement notice to be issued to a person for an alleged contravention of an infringement notice provision; or  (b) affect the liability of a person to proceedings under Chapter 4 or Part 5-2 of the Australian Consumer Law in relation to an alleged contravention of an infringement notice provision if:  (i) an infringement notice is not issued to the person for the alleged contravention; or  (ii) an infringement notice issued to a person for the alleged contravention is withdrawn under section 134G; or  (c) prevent a court from imposing a higher penalty than the penalty specified in the infringement notice if the person does not comply with the notice." ;
    skos:definition "(2) This Division does not:  (a) require an infringement notice to be issued to a person for an alleged contravention of an infringement notice provision; or  (b) affect the liability of a person to proceedings under Chapter 4 or Part 5-2 of the Australian Consumer Law in relation to an alleged contravention of an infringement notice provision if:  (i) an infringement notice is not issued to the person for the alleged contravention; or  (ii) an infringement notice issued to a person for the alleged contravention is withdrawn under section 134G; or  (c) prevent a court from imposing a higher penalty than the penalty specified in the infringement notice if the person does not comply with the notice."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "794349fc1d8ee22eb2d359896ca14ee926a47e8453b7fa41b0f98e1313d2e0e5" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-134 ;
    cof:pageNumber "144"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Does not require an infringement notice to be issued for certain contraventions." ;
