concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "135C Failure to answer questions or produce documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-135c ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person is subject to a requirement under subsection 135B(2); and  (b) the person fails to comply with the requirement. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—150 penalty units; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—30 penalty units.  (2) A person is not excused from:  (a) answering a question; or  (b) producing a document;  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person is subject to a requirement under subsection 135B(2); and  (b) the person fails to comply with the requirement. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—150 penalty units; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—30 penalty units.  (2) A person is not excused from:  (a) answering a question; or  (b) producing a document;  Chapter 6  Other provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b94545bc97a19e2b0a24e0469ae1cc75eb4c71a20022edd6b97ccf5c57b31c74" ;
    cof:pageNumber "157"^^xsd:integer ;
