doc:sec-135f-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "135F(3) Announcement before entry under warrant" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If:  (a) the inspector does not comply with subsection (1) because of subsection (2); and  (b) the occupier of the premises, or another person who apparently represents the occupier, is present at the premises; the inspector must, as soon as practicable after entering the premises, show his or her identity card to the occupier or other person.  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    cof:pageNumber "159"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135g a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "135G Inspector must be in possession of search warrant"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-135g ;
    values:originalText "If a search warrant is being executed in relation to premises, an inspector executing the warrant must be in possession of:  (a) the warrant issued under section 135Z or a copy of that warrant; or  (b) the form of warrant completed under subsection 136(7), or a copy of that form. Subdivision B—Obligations of inspectors" ;
    skos:definition "If a search warrant is being executed in relation to premises, an inspector executing the warrant must be in possession of:  (a) the warrant issued under section 135Z or a copy of that warrant; or  (b) the form of warrant completed under subsection 136(7), or a copy of that form. Subdivision B—Obligations of inspectors"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c36b667f0270128c5e8d8148ccf5b9d081f3c2cdc0c37cf556ede5be322af6a8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "160"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Inspector must be in possession of search warrant" ;
    dc:description "a) the warrant issued under section 135Z or a copy of that warrant; or b) the form of warrant completed under subsection 136(7), or a copy of that form." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
