concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135l a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "135L Occupier etc. to provide inspector etc. with facilities and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-135l ;
    values:originalText "assistance  (1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person is:  (i) the occupier of premises to which a search warrant relates; or  (ii) another person who apparently represents the occupier of those premises; and  (b) the person fails to provide:  (i) an inspector executing the warrant; and  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "assistance  (1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person is:  (i) the occupier of premises to which a search warrant relates; or  (ii) another person who apparently represents the occupier of those premises; and  (b) the person fails to provide:  (i) an inspector executing the warrant; and  Chapter 6  Other provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "eea6d8a33b3e2a6292397d714e8df4a5e14a90775ad15832556e9bf9308cb6b6" ;
