doc:sec-135r-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "135R(2) Destruction or disposal of seized consumer goods or" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If subparagraph (1)(c)(ii) applies, the inspector must, before making an application under subsection (1), inform the person referred to in that subparagraph that the inspector proposes to make an application under that subsection." ;
    cof:pageNumber "164"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135r-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "135R(3) Destruction or disposal of seized consumer goods or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-135r-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If:  (a) an order is made under subsection (1); and  (b) subparagraph (1)(c)(ii) applies; the person referred to in that subparagraph is liable to pay an amount equal to the costs reasonably incurred by the inspector in destroying or disposing of the consumer goods or equipment." ;
    skos:definition "(3) If:  (a) an order is made under subsection (1); and  (b) subparagraph (1)(c)(ii) applies; the person referred to in that subparagraph is liable to pay an amount equal to the costs reasonably incurred by the inspector in destroying or disposing of the consumer goods or equipment."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "712cf4d8538fb0cee6bc131ff1973e63bab9c7764c7b23f12a9e2281c88cba78" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-135r ;
    cof:pageNumber "164"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Liability for costs of destroying or disposing of seized consumer goods or equipment." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
