doc:sec-135z-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "135Z(1) Issue of search warrants" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) An inspector may apply to a judge of the Federal Court by telephone, fax or other electronic means for a warrant under section 135Z in relation to premises if the inspector believes on reasonable grounds that the delay that would occur if an application were made in person would frustrate the effective execution of the warrant.  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    cof:pageNumber "170"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-136b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "136B Powers of judges"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-136b ;
    values:originalText "Powers conferred personally  (1) A power conferred on a judge by this Division is conferred on the judge:  (a) in a personal capacity; and  (b) not as a court or a member of a court. Powers need not be accepted  (2) The judge need not accept the power conferred. Protection and immunity  (3) A judge exercising a power conferred by this Division has the same protection and immunity as if he or she were exercising the power:  (a) as the court of which the judge is a member; or  (b) as a member of the court of which the judge is a member.  Other provisions  Chapter 6 Application of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of the Commonwealth  Part XI Remedies  Division 7  Section 137  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
    skos:definition "Powers conferred personally  (1) A power conferred on a judge by this Division is conferred on the judge:  (a) in a personal capacity; and  (b) not as a court or a member of a court. Powers need not be accepted  (2) The judge need not accept the power conferred. Protection and immunity  (3) A judge exercising a power conferred by this Division has the same protection and immunity as if he or she were exercising the power:  (a) as the court of which the judge is a member; or  (b) as a member of the court of which the judge is a member.  Other provisions  Chapter 6 Application of the Australian Consumer Law as a law of the Commonwealth  Part XI Remedies  Division 7  Section 137  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a3d9ce38f203e8b183955c1df3c707be225fa24ea2ebd96628bb6f45dc1fcae0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "174"^^xsd:integer ;
