concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-137c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "137C Limits on recovery of amounts for death or personal injury"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-137c ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person is not entitled to recover an amount of loss or damage by action under subsection 236(1) of the Australian Consumer Law to the extent to which:  (a) the action would be based on the conduct contravening a provision of Part 2-1 or 3-1 of the Australian Consumer Law; and  (b) the loss or damage is, or results from, death or personal injury; and  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person is not entitled to recover an amount of loss or damage by action under subsection 236(1) of the Australian Consumer Law to the extent to which:  (a) the action would be based on the conduct contravening a provision of Part 2-1 or 3-1 of the Australian Consumer Law; and  (b) the loss or damage is, or results from, death or personal injury; and  Chapter 6  Other provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d742ff3a231c366b198dac554981612f05a7dfb6c48f276f67b8dcd41c594a6b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "177"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Limits recovery of amounts for death or personal injury based on certain conduct." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
