    cof:title "150C The Competition Code" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Competition Code consists of:  (a) the Schedule version of Part IV;  (b) the remaining provisions of this Act (except sections 2A, 5, 6 and 172), so far as they would relate to the Schedule version if the Schedule version were substituted for Part IV;  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
