concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-150d a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "150D Federal Court may exercise jurisdiction under application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-150d ;
    values:originalText "laws of Territories  The Federal Court may exercise jurisdiction (whether original or appellate) conferred on that Court by an application law of a Territory with respect to matters arising under the Competition Code." ;
