    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (1) does not authorise the conferral of a function or power, or the imposition of a duty, by an application law to the extent to which:  Other provisions  Chapter 6 The Competition Code  Part XIA  Section 150FA  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (a) the conferral or imposition, or the authorisation, would contravene any constitutional doctrines restricting the duties that may be imposed on the Commonwealth entity; or  (b) the authorisation would otherwise exceed the legislative power of the Commonwealth." ;
