concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-150fa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "150FA How duty is imposed"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-150fa ;
    values:originalText "Application  (1) This section applies if an application law purports to impose a duty on a Commonwealth entity. Note: Section 150FB sets out when such a law imposes a duty on a Commonwealth entity. State or Territory legislative power sufficient to support duty  (2) The duty is taken not to be imposed by this Act (or any other law of the Commonwealth) to the extent to which:  (a) imposing the duty is within the legislative powers of the State or Territory concerned; and  (b) imposing the duty by the law of the State or Territory is consistent with the constitutional doctrines restricting the duties that may be imposed on the entity. Note: If this subsection applies, the duty will be taken to be imposed by force of the law of the State or Territory (the Commonwealth having consented under section 150F to the imposition of the duty by that law).  Chapter 6  Other provisions" ;
    skos:definition "Application  (1) This section applies if an application law purports to impose a duty on a Commonwealth entity. Note: Section 150FB sets out when such a law imposes a duty on a Commonwealth entity. State or Territory legislative power sufficient to support duty  (2) The duty is taken not to be imposed by this Act (or any other law of the Commonwealth) to the extent to which:  (a) imposing the duty is within the legislative powers of the State or Territory concerned; and  (b) imposing the duty by the law of the State or Territory is consistent with the constitutional doctrines restricting the duties that may be imposed on the entity. Note: If this subsection applies, the duty will be taken to be imposed by force of the law of the State or Territory (the Commonwealth having consented under section 150F to the imposition of the duty by that law).  Chapter 6  Other provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e7ad522ea327e5ba95534ef8355038ef7f7b86328c7cf9175886f60464c40d28" ;
    cof:pageNumber "209"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-150fa-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-150fa-ss-2 ;
