concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-150j a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "150J Authorisations etc. under this Act may relate also to"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-150j ;
    values:originalText "Competition Code  The validity of an authorisation, notification, determination or any other thing given or done for the purposes of this Act is not affected only because it was given or done also for the purposes of the Competition Code.  Other provisions  Chapter 6 The Competition Code  Part XIA  Section 150K  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
    skos:definition "Competition Code  The validity of an authorisation, notification, determination or any other thing given or done for the purposes of this Act is not affected only because it was given or done also for the purposes of the Competition Code.  Other provisions  Chapter 6 The Competition Code  Part XIA  Section 150K  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026"@en ;
