concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151af a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151AF Telecommunications market"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151af ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of this Part, a telecommunications market is a market in which any of the following goods or services are supplied or acquired:  (a) carriage services;  (b) goods or services for use in connection with a carriage service;  (c) access to facilities;  (d) content services. Note: Market has a meaning affected by section 4E. 151AG  When a body corporate is related to a partnership  For the purposes of this Part, if:  (a) a carrier or a carriage service provider is a partnership; and  (b) a body corporate is related to a partner in the partnership;  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules" ;
    skos:definition "For the purposes of this Part, a telecommunications market is a market in which any of the following goods or services are supplied or acquired:  (a) carriage services;  (b) goods or services for use in connection with a carriage service;  (c) access to facilities;  (d) content services. Note: Market has a meaning affected by section 4E. 151AG  When a body corporate is related to a partnership  For the purposes of this Part, if:  (a) a carrier or a carriage service provider is a partnership; and  (b) a body corporate is related to a partner in the partnership;  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "564f149983ebcee74855307161df53601efad5e9a7a50c51e2d8395a1e0e771c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "218"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines telecommunications market for purposes of Part" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.218" ;
