concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ai a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151AI Interpretation of Part IV, IVA or VII not affected by this"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151ai ;
    values:originalText "Part  In determining the meaning of a provision of Part IV, IVA or VII, the provisions of this Part are to be ignored.  Chapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc." ;
