concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ak a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151AK The competition rule"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151ak ;
    values:originalText "(1) A carrier or carriage service provider must not engage in anti-competitive conduct.  (2) For the purposes of this Part, the rule set out in subsection (1) is to be known as the competition rule. Note: For enforcement of the competition rule, see Division 7.  Chapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A carrier or carriage service provider must not engage in anti-competitive conduct.  (2) For the purposes of this Part, the rule set out in subsection (1) is to be known as the competition rule. Note: For enforcement of the competition rule, see Division 7.  Chapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."@en ;
