concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151an a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151AN Evidentiary effect of competition notice"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151an ;
    values:originalText "(1) In any proceedings under, or arising out of, this Part, a Part B competition notice is prima facie evidence of the matters in the notice.  (2) A document purporting to be a competition notice must, unless the contrary is established, be taken to be a competition notice and to have been properly issued.  (3) The Commission may certify that a document is a copy of a competition notice.  (4) This section applies to the certified copy as if it were the original." ;
    skos:definition "(1) In any proceedings under, or arising out of, this Part, a Part B competition notice is prima facie evidence of the matters in the notice.  (2) A document purporting to be a competition notice must, unless the contrary is established, be taken to be a competition notice and to have been properly issued.  (3) The Commission may certify that a document is a copy of a competition notice.  (4) This section applies to the certified copy as if it were the original."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "256f56f5541ed3a578e353f13f1a737319982a8d342c2fbf90e79bc1431f286d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "228"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151an-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151an-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151an-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151an-ss-4 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
