doc:sec-151aq-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151AQ(1) Commission to act expeditiously" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Paragraphs 15(1)(a) and (b) and 15A(1)(a) and (b) of the Administrative Decisions (Judicial Review) Act 1977 do not apply to a decision to issue a competition notice." ;
    cof:pageNumber "230"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151aq-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151AQ(2) Commission to act expeditiously"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151aq-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If a person applies to the Federal Court under subsection 39B(1) of the Judiciary Act 1903 for a writ or injunction in relation to a decision to issue a competition notice, the Court must not make any orders staying or otherwise affecting the operation or implementation of the decision pending the finalisation of the application. However, this subsection does not apply to an order under subsection (3)." ;
    skos:definition "(2) If a person applies to the Federal Court under subsection 39B(1) of the Judiciary Act 1903 for a writ or injunction in relation to a decision to issue a competition notice, the Court must not make any orders staying or otherwise affecting the operation or implementation of the decision pending the finalisation of the application. However, this subsection does not apply to an order under subsection (3)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bf359b1db42e4ed2951b76090260db3dca66b048618b0a443958f64b69fe8a76" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151aq ;
    cof:pageNumber "230"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Failure to comply does not affect competition notice validity Court must not make orders staying or affecting the operation of a decision pending its finalisation." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.230" ;
    cml:asserts concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151aq-ss-2-norm .
