concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ax a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151AX Commission may refuse to consider application if it relates to"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151ax ;
    values:originalText "the same conduct as an authorisation application  (1) This section applies if:  (a) the Commission receives, or has received, an application for an exemption order; and  (b) the Commission receives, or has received, an application for an authorisation under Division 1 of Part VII; and  (c) the application for the exemption order and the application for the authorisation relate to the same conduct.  (2) The Commission may refuse to:  (a) consider the application for the exemption order; or  (b) convene a conference under section 151AZ to discuss the application for the exemption order; until:  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules" ;
    skos:definition "the same conduct as an authorisation application  (1) This section applies if:  (a) the Commission receives, or has received, an application for an exemption order; and  (b) the Commission receives, or has received, an application for an authorisation under Division 1 of Part VII; and  (c) the application for the exemption order and the application for the authorisation relate to the same conduct.  (2) The Commission may refuse to:  (a) consider the application for the exemption order; or  (b) convene a conference under section 151AZ to discuss the application for the exemption order; until:  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d728f1c1dba2a2622f7d3279eb2f7d292b3174b1bd7b44e5b3932c18089709f3" ;
    cof:pageNumber "234"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ax-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ax-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.234" .
