concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151bd a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151BD Notification of decision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151bd ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the Commission makes an exemption order, the Commission must give the applicant a written notice setting out the order and the reasons for the order.  (2) If the Commission refuses to make an exemption order, the Commission must give the applicant a written notice stating that the order has been refused and setting out the reasons for the refusal." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If the Commission makes an exemption order, the Commission must give the applicant a written notice setting out the order and the reasons for the order.  (2) If the Commission refuses to make an exemption order, the Commission must give the applicant a written notice stating that the order has been refused and setting out the reasons for the refusal."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f9736860f79bde9ebc6294b98c26142075e68a826434d8c7a64a95bfc0db84ea" ;
    cof:pageNumber "238"^^xsd:integer ;
