    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) an exemption order is in force in relation to a person; and  (b) the Commission is satisfied that:  (i) the order was made on the basis of information that was false or misleading in a material particular; or  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules" ;
    cof:pageNumber "238"^^xsd:integer .

