concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ce a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151CE Other orders—compensation for breach of the competition"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151ce ;
    values:originalText "rule  (1) If, in a proceeding instituted under this Division in relation to a contravention of the competition rule, the Federal Court finds that a person who is a party to the proceeding has suffered, or is likely to suffer, loss or damage by conduct of another person that was engaged in in contravention of the competition rule, the Court may, on the application of a party to the proceedings, make such orders as it thinks appropriate against:  (a) the person who engaged in the conduct; or  (b) a person who was involved in the contravention; if the Court considers that the orders concerned will:  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules" ;
    skos:definition "rule  (1) If, in a proceeding instituted under this Division in relation to a contravention of the competition rule, the Federal Court finds that a person who is a party to the proceeding has suffered, or is likely to suffer, loss or damage by conduct of another person that was engaged in in contravention of the competition rule, the Court may, on the application of a party to the proceedings, make such orders as it thinks appropriate against:  (a) the person who engaged in the conduct; or  (b) a person who was involved in the contravention; if the Court considers that the orders concerned will:  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a26067d2963c6c4211b98e3abd8e7d38f4559f140271a8358534b7f52eda0e6b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "272"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Court may make orders against a person who engaged in contravention of the competition rule or a person involved in the contravention." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.272" ;
    cml:asserts concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ce-norm .
