concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151cf a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151CF Conduct by directors, employees or agents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151cf ;
    values:originalText "Part 32 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 applies in relation to proceedings under this Division in a corresponding way to the way in which it applies to proceedings under that Act (as defined by section 574 of that Act).  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules" ;
    skos:definition "Part 32 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 applies in relation to proceedings under this Division in a corresponding way to the way in which it applies to proceedings under that Act (as defined by section 574 of that Act).  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8e1a418aa729ff61248ef45ce6535c72d2f69fc32924282717dd51548ac27031" ;
