concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ci-ss-3a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151CI(3A) Review by Tribunal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151ci-ss-3a ;
    values:originalText "(3A) If the Commission:  (a) makes a decision under section 151BUA to make a report obtained from a person, or an extract from such a report, available for inspection and purchase; or  (b) makes a decision under section 151BUB or 151BUC to give a person a written direction to make a report or extract available for inspection and purchase; the person may apply to the Tribunal for a review of the decision." ;
    skos:definition "(3A) If the Commission:  (a) makes a decision under section 151BUA to make a report obtained from a person, or an extract from such a report, available for inspection and purchase; or  (b) makes a decision under section 151BUB or 151BUC to give a person a written direction to make a report or extract available for inspection and purchase; the person may apply to the Tribunal for a review of the decision."@en ;
