concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ci-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151CI(4) Review by Tribunal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151ci-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) An application under this section for a review of a decision must be:  (a) in writing; and  (b) in the case of an application under subsection (1) or (2)— made within 21 days after the Commission made the decision; and  (c) in the case of an application under subsection (3)—made within 7 days after the Commission made the decision; and  (d) in the case of an application under subsection (3A)—made within 28 days after the Commission made the decision." ;
    skos:definition "(4) An application under this section for a review of a decision must be:  (a) in writing; and  (b) in the case of an application under subsection (1) or (2)— made within 21 days after the Commission made the decision; and  (c) in the case of an application under subsection (3)—made within 7 days after the Commission made the decision; and  (d) in the case of an application under subsection (3A)—made within 28 days after the Commission made the decision."@en ;
