concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151ci-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151CI(5) Review by Tribunal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151ci-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If the Tribunal receives an application under this section for a review of a decision, the Tribunal must review the decision.  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules" ;
    skos:definition "(5) If the Tribunal receives an application under this section for a review of a decision, the Tribunal must review the decision.  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules"@en ;
