doc:sec-151cl-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151CL(7) Reviews of competitive safeguards within the" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) In this section: telecommunications industry has the same meaning as in the Telecommunications Act 1997.  Chapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc." ;
    cof:pageNumber "281"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-151cm a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151CM Monitoring of telecommunications charges paid by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-151cm ;
    values:originalText "consumers  (1) The Commission must monitor, and report each financial year on, charges paid by consumers in telecommunications markets.  (2) The Commission may decide which charges to monitor and report on, having regard to which goods or services are most commonly used by consumers.  (3) The Commission must publish the report on its website as soon as practicable and no later than 6 months after the end of the financial year concerned.  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules" ;
    skos:definition "consumers  (1) The Commission must monitor, and report each financial year on, charges paid by consumers in telecommunications markets.  (2) The Commission may decide which charges to monitor and report on, having regard to which goods or services are most commonly used by consumers.  (3) The Commission must publish the report on its website as soon as practicable and no later than 6 months after the end of the financial year concerned.  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Telecommunications Industry: Anti-competitive conduct and record-keeping rules"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2a49fdd64f2ae219b4e46fe5f730ff82774fa4345132e09feb501d91f05cb783" ;
