concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152aj a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "152AJ Interpretation of Part IIIA not affected by this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-152aj ;
    values:originalText "In determining the meaning of a provision of Part IIIA, the provisions of this Part (other than section 152CK) are to be ignored." ;
