doc:sec-152aq-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "152AQ(1) Register of declared services" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the operation of any or all of the following provisions:  (a) subsection 152AL(9), (10), (11), (12), (13) or (14);  (b) subsection 152ALA(10), (11), (12) or (13); would result in an acquisition of property from a person otherwise than on just terms, the Commonwealth is liable to pay a reasonable amount of compensation to the person." ;
