concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ar-ss-4b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "152AR(4B) Category A standard access obligations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-152ar-ss-4b ;
    values:originalText "(4B) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of subsection (4A), a specified act or thing is taken to be ordering. Note: For specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act 2003.  Chapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc." ;
