concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152bc-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "152BC(7) Access determinations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-152bc-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) An access determination may provide for the Commission to perform functions, and exercise powers, under the determination.  Chapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc." ;
