    cof:title "152CC Register of access undertakings" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commission is to maintain a Register in which the Commission includes:  (a) all access undertakings that have been accepted by the Commission (including those that are no longer in operation); and  (b) all variations of access undertakings.  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 Telecommunications access regime  Part XIC Access undertakings  Division 5  Section 152CD  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) The Register is to be maintained by electronic means.  (3) The Register is to be made available for inspection on the Commission’s website.  (4) The Register is not a legislative instrument." ;
    cof:pageNumber "410"^^xsd:integer .

