concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152ci a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "152CI Undertakings, access determinations and binding rules of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-152ci ;
    values:originalText "conduct that are inconsistent with Ministerial pricing determinations  (1) If a provision of an access undertaking is inconsistent with any Ministerial pricing determination, the provision has no effect to the extent of the inconsistency.  (2) If a provision of an access determination is inconsistent with any Ministerial pricing determination, the provision has no effect to the extent of the inconsistency.  Chapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc." ;
