concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-152cj a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "152CJ Register of Ministerial pricing determinations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-152cj ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commission must keep a Register of Ministerial pricing determinations.  (2) The Register is to be maintained by electronic means.  (3) The Register is to be made available for inspection on the Commission’s website.  (4) The Register is not a legislative instrument.  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 Telecommunications access regime  Part XIC Supply of services by NBN corporations  Division 6A  Section 152CJA  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Commission must keep a Register of Ministerial pricing determinations.  (2) The Register is to be maintained by electronic means.  (3) The Register is to be made available for inspection on the Commission’s website.  (4) The Register is not a legislative instrument.  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 Telecommunications access regime  Part XIC Supply of services by NBN corporations  Division 6A  Section 152CJA  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6cf12258218391abfc8d5d5c0d6350608f364dcda6e218590b2f2243ad9c2008" ;
