    skos:prefLabel "152EO(4) Conduct by directors, servants or agents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-152eo-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A reference in this section to a director of a body corporate includes a reference to a constituent member of a body corporate incorporated for a public purpose by a law of the Commonwealth, of a State or of a Territory." ;
