concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153e-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "153E(3) Prohibited conduct—retail pricing"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-153e-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Despite subsection (1), the corporation does not contravene this section if the adjustments would contravene:  (a) an Act of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory; or  (b) an instrument made under such an Act." ;
