doc:sec-153l-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "153L(3) Commission may give draft public warning notice" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A notice given under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument.  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Electricity Industry  Part XICA Commission responses  Division 3  Section 153M  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
