    skos:prefLabel "153N Infringement notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-153n ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to subsection (2), Division 5 of Part V applies in relation to an alleged contravention of section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H in the same way in which it applies in relation to an alleged  Chapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subject to subsection (2), Division 5 of Part V applies in relation to an alleged contravention of section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H in the same way in which it applies in relation to an alleged  Chapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."@en ;
