concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153v-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "153V(3) Commission may vary or revoke no Treasurer action notice"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-153v-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Commission cannot make a variation under subsection (1) unless the Commission is satisfied that the variation is minor or insubstantial.  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Electricity Industry  Part XICA Procedure before contracting order or divestiture order  Division 4  Section 153V  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The Commission cannot make a variation under subsection (1) unless the Commission is satisfied that the variation is minor or insubstantial.  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Electricity Industry  Part XICA Procedure before contracting order or divestiture order  Division 4  Section 153V  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fa21057256823122c06c2d70c887bbcde3c8ec4c0a5823f4c678f09d0130b152" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153v ;
