doc:sec-153x-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "153X(3) Treasurer may make contracting order" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The matters are as follows:  (a) the kind of offers that the body corporate must make to enter into electricity financial contracts;  (b) the manner in which the body corporate must make those offers;  (c) the kind of entities to which those offers must be made;  (d) the period or periods during which the body corporate must make those offers;  (e) any other matter that the Treasurer considers necessary for the order to be effective." ;
    cof:pageNumber "452"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153x-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "153X(4) Treasurer may make contracting order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-153x-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The order may specify the kind of offers that the body corporate must make in any of the following ways:  (a) the kind of electricity financial contracts that must be offered;  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Electricity Industry  Part XICA Contracting orders  Division 5  Section 153Y  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (b) the price or range of prices in respect of electricity under the electricity financial contracts that must be offered, or a method or methods of working out that price or that range;  (c) the minimum number of megawatt hours of electricity to which the electricity financial contracts that must be offered must relate." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The order may specify the kind of offers that the body corporate must make in any of the following ways:  (a) the kind of electricity financial contracts that must be offered;  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc.  Chapter 7 The Electricity Industry  Part XICA Contracting orders  Division 5  Section 153Y  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (b) the price or range of prices in respect of electricity under the electricity financial contracts that must be offered, or a method or methods of working out that price or that range;  (c) the minimum number of megawatt hours of electricity to which the electricity financial contracts that must be offered must relate."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6211e9e92b57f98197de2beebe18b163840be39184c58d3e5d38aec49784148e" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153x ;
    cof:pageNumber "452"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Treasurer must specify the kind of offers that the body corporate must make in certain ways." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
