doc:sec-153x-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "153X(5) Treasurer may make contracting order" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) In determining the minimum number of megawatt hours to specify for the purposes of paragraph (4)(c), the Treasurer must have regard to the following matters:  (a) the total electricity generation capacity of the electricity generation assets held by each connected body corporate in relation to the prohibited conduct and related bodies corporate;  (b) the nature and location of those electricity generation assets;  (c) the commitments that the body corporate has, and related bodies corporate have, to supply electricity to customers;  (d) any other matter that the Treasurer considers to be relevant." ;
    cof:pageNumber "452"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153x-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "153X(6) Treasurer may make contracting order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-153x-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) The specified period or periods during which the body corporate must make those offers must:  (a) start no earlier than 6 months after the order is made; and  (b) end no later than 3 years after the order is made." ;
    skos:definition "(6) The specified period or periods during which the body corporate must make those offers must:  (a) start no earlier than 6 months after the order is made; and  (b) end no later than 3 years after the order is made."@en ;
