concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153y a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "153Y Variation and revocation of contracting order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-153y ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Treasurer may, in writing, vary or revoke a contracting order in respect of a body corporate, on the Treasurer’s own initiative or on application made by the body corporate.  (2) The Treasurer cannot make a variation under subsection (1) unless the Treasurer is satisfied that:  Chapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Treasurer may, in writing, vary or revoke a contracting order in respect of a body corporate, on the Treasurer’s own initiative or on application made by the body corporate.  (2) The Treasurer cannot make a variation under subsection (1) unless the Treasurer is satisfied that:  Chapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."@en ;
