concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153zd a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "153ZD No orders under subsection 76(1) against certain individuals"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-153zd ;
    values:originalText "(1) Nothing in subsection 76(1) authorises the making of an order against an individual covered under subsection (2) because the individual:  (a) has aided, abetted, counselled or procured a corporation to contravene section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H; or  (b) has induced, or attempted to induce, a corporation, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, to contravene section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H; or  (c) has been in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, the contravention by a corporation of section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H; or  (d) has conspired with others for a corporation to contravene section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H.  (2) An individual is covered under this section unless the individual is a director, secretary or senior manager (within the meaning of the Corporations Act 2001) of the corporation.  Chapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Nothing in subsection 76(1) authorises the making of an order against an individual covered under subsection (2) because the individual:  (a) has aided, abetted, counselled or procured a corporation to contravene section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H; or  (b) has induced, or attempted to induce, a corporation, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, to contravene section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H; or  (c) has been in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, the contravention by a corporation of section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H; or  (d) has conspired with others for a corporation to contravene section 153E, 153F, 153G or 153H.  (2) An individual is covered under this section unless the individual is a director, secretary or senior manager (within the meaning of the Corporations Act 2001) of the corporation.  Chapter 7  Further provisions relating to particular industries etc."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b51cdda9c9173d95215a531cb10c53627163373fb2f81a9759bdb7647d9812f9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "461"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153zd-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-153zd-ss-2 ;
