concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154c-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "154C(7) Identity cards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-154c-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) An inspector is not entitled to exercise any powers under this Part in relation to premises if:  (a) the occupier of the premises has requested the inspector to produce the inspector’s identity card for inspection by the occupier; and  (b) the inspector fails to comply with the request.  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous" ;
