    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) a search warrant is in force in relation to premises; and  (b) the executing officer or an officer assisting believes on reasonable grounds that any data accessed by operating electronic equipment at the premises (including data not held  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous" ;
