concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154j-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "154J(3) Securing electronic equipment for use by experts"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-154j-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The equipment may be secured:  (a) for a period not exceeding 24 hours; or  (b) until the equipment has been operated by the expert; whichever happens first.  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous" ;
