concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154ze a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "154ZE Definitions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-154ze ;
    values:originalText "In this Part: approval means an approval as a designated complainant granted under subsection 154ZQ(1). designated complainant means an entity that has an approval that is in force.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Designated complaints  Part XIE Preliminary  Division 1  Section 154ZE  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  designated complaints determination means the determination made by the Minister under section 154ZZ. entity means any of the following:  (a) a corporation;  (b) an individual;  (c) a body corporate;  (d) a corporation sole;  (e) a body politic;  (f) a partnership;  (g) any other unincorporated association or body of entities;  (h) a trust.  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "In this Part: approval means an approval as a designated complainant granted under subsection 154ZQ(1). designated complainant means an entity that has an approval that is in force.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Designated complaints  Part XIE Preliminary  Division 1  Section 154ZE  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  designated complaints determination means the determination made by the Minister under section 154ZZ. entity means any of the following:  (a) a corporation;  (b) an individual;  (c) a body corporate;  (d) a corporation sole;  (e) a body politic;  (f) a partnership;  (g) any other unincorporated association or body of entities;  (h) a trust.  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "102336a3442d6ab746bfd43e25f706697b3f26fdcd0be0b634705fe1b75ff81b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "518"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Definitions for designated complaints determination and entity" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
