concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zg a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "154ZG Commission to respond by giving notice"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-154zg ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the Commission receives a designated complaint from a designated complainant, the Commission must, within 90 days, assess the complaint and give the complainant one of the following:  (a) a notice under subsection 154ZH(1) (no further action on complaint);  (b) a notice under subsection 154ZK(1) (further action to deal with complaint).  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Designated complaints  Part XIE Commission handling of designated complaints  Division 2  Section 154ZH  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) If, before the Commission gives a notice mentioned in subsection (1) to the complainant, it ceases to be a designated complainant, for the purposes of subsection (1), the complaint is taken never to have been made." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If the Commission receives a designated complaint from a designated complainant, the Commission must, within 90 days, assess the complaint and give the complainant one of the following:  (a) a notice under subsection 154ZH(1) (no further action on complaint);  (b) a notice under subsection 154ZK(1) (further action to deal with complaint).  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Designated complaints  Part XIE Commission handling of designated complaints  Division 2  Section 154ZH  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) If, before the Commission gives a notice mentioned in subsection (1) to the complainant, it ceases to be a designated complainant, for the purposes of subsection (1), the complaint is taken never to have been made."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f30d2d859851a4e7c931419ec3acb310a9441f2f94830705af5c3a04674d09c6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "520"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zg-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zg-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.520" .
