concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zq-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "154ZQ(5) Minister may grant approval"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-154zq-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) However, the Minister must not grant the approval if doing so would result in the number of designated complainants being  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Designated complaints  Part XIE Designated complainants  Division 3  Section 154ZR  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  above the limit prescribed in the designated complaints determination." ;
