concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zs a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "154ZS Contents of approval"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-154zs ;
    values:originalText "The approval must set out the following:  (a) the name of the designated complainant;  (b) the date (if any) on which the approval ceases to be in force;  (c) the conditions (if any) to which the approval is subject.  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "The approval must set out the following:  (a) the name of the designated complainant;  (b) the date (if any) on which the approval ceases to be in force;  (c) the conditions (if any) to which the approval is subject.  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous"@en ;
