concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-154zy a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "154ZY Delegation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-154zy ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, in writing, delegate all or any of the Minister’s powers or functions under this Part (other than under section 154ZZ) to the Secretary, or a SES employee or acting SES employee in the Department.  (2) In exercising a power under a delegation under this section, the delegate must comply with any written directions of the Minister." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, in writing, delegate all or any of the Minister’s powers or functions under this Part (other than under section 154ZZ) to the Secretary, or a SES employee or acting SES employee in the Department.  (2) In exercising a power under a delegation under this section, the delegate must comply with any written directions of the Minister."@en ;
