    skos:definition "(7B) This section does not require a person to produce a document that would disclose information that is the subject of legal professional privilege. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this subsection (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code).  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous"@en ;
