concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-155aa-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "155AA(3) Protection of Part VB information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-155aa-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In this section: Commission official means:  (a) a member, or associate member, of the Commission;  (b) a person referred to in subsection 27(1);  (c) a person engaged under section 27A. disclose means divulge or communicate. information includes information in a document and information given in evidence. protected Part VB information means:  (a) information that:  (i) was obtained by the Commission under Part XID or section 155; and  (ii) relates to a matter that arose under Part VB before its repeal by item 32 of Schedule 1 to the Statute Stocktake (Regulatory and Other Laws) Act 2009; or  (b) information that was obtained by the Commission under section 75AY before its repeal by item 32 of Schedule 1 to the Statute Stocktake (Regulatory and Other Laws) Act 2009." ;
    skos:definition "(3) In this section: Commission official means:  (a) a member, or associate member, of the Commission;  (b) a person referred to in subsection 27(1);  (c) a person engaged under section 27A. disclose means divulge or communicate. information includes information in a document and information given in evidence. protected Part VB information means:  (a) information that:  (i) was obtained by the Commission under Part XID or section 155; and  (ii) relates to a matter that arose under Part VB before its repeal by item 32 of Schedule 1 to the Statute Stocktake (Regulatory and Other Laws) Act 2009; or  (b) information that was obtained by the Commission under section 75AY before its repeal by item 32 of Schedule 1 to the Statute Stocktake (Regulatory and Other Laws) Act 2009."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "36cc8334c695a10e0bbbd617f44b42cf57e012317a65da50a170d6cd602039ee" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-155aa ;
