concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "157A Disclosure of energy-related information by Commission"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-157a ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commission or a Commission official may disclose to:  (a) the AER; or  (b) the AEMC; or  (c) any staff or consultant assisting the AER or the AEMC in performing its functions or exercising its powers; any information that it obtains under this Act or a gas market instrument that is relevant to the functions or powers of the AER or the AEMC. Note: The Privacy Act 1988 also contains provisions relevant to the use and disclosure of information.  (2) The AER or a person mentioned in paragraph (1)(c) may use the information for any purpose connected with the performance of the AER’s functions or the exercise of its powers.  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Commission or a Commission official may disclose to:  (a) the AER; or  (b) the AEMC; or  (c) any staff or consultant assisting the AER or the AEMC in performing its functions or exercising its powers; any information that it obtains under this Act or a gas market instrument that is relevant to the functions or powers of the AER or the AEMC. Note: The Privacy Act 1988 also contains provisions relevant to the use and disclosure of information.  (2) The AER or a person mentioned in paragraph (1)(c) may use the information for any purpose connected with the performance of the AER’s functions or the exercise of its powers.  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0061cd217379b182c345954b78b613327f2b1bac00be01d5d79392844a6865b7" ;
