doc:sec-157a-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "157A(1) Disclosure of energy-related information by Commission" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commission or a Commission official may disclose to:  (a) the AER; or  (b) the AEMC; or  (c) any staff or consultant assisting the AER or the AEMC in performing its functions or exercising its powers; any information that it obtains under this Act or a gas market instrument that is relevant to the functions or powers of the AER or the AEMC. Note: The Privacy Act 1988 also contains provisions relevant to the use and disclosure of information." ;
    cof:pageNumber "555"^^xsd:integer .

