    values:originalText "(2) The Information Commissioner or a person mentioned in paragraph (1)(b) must only use the information:  (a) for a purpose connected with the performance of the functions, or the exercise of the powers, referred to in paragraph (1)(b); and  (b) in accordance with any conditions imposed under subsection (4).  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Miscellaneous  Part XII  Section 157AA  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  Disclosure to the Secretary" ;
