concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157aa-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "157AA(3) Disclosure of CDR-related information by Commission"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-157aa-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Commission or a Commission official may disclose to:  (a) an agency having the function in a foreign country of supervising or regulating the disclosure of similar information to that covered by an instrument designating a sector under subsection 56AC(2); or  (aa) an agency having the function in a foreign country of supervising or regulating types of actions similar to those declared under section 56ACA; or  (b) an agency, that is prescribed by the regulations, of a foreign country; any information that the Commission obtains:  (c) under this Act in relation to Part IVD or the consumer data rules; or  (d) under the consumer data rules.  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The Commission or a Commission official may disclose to:  (a) an agency having the function in a foreign country of supervising or regulating the disclosure of similar information to that covered by an instrument designating a sector under subsection 56AC(2); or  (aa) an agency having the function in a foreign country of supervising or regulating types of actions similar to those declared under section 56ACA; or  (b) an agency, that is prescribed by the regulations, of a foreign country; any information that the Commission obtains:  (c) under this Act in relation to Part IVD or the consumer data rules; or  (d) under the consumer data rules.  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "73f5dcd1c5f11ea23dd9133306ec38ce7015087c14a87de62e7f89ef1f79a8ae" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157aa ;
    cof:pageNumber "556"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Disclosure of CDR-related information to certain agencies" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.556" ;
