concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157b-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "157B(3) Disclosure of protected cartel information to a court or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-157b-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If:  (a) a document is produced; or  (b) information is disclosed; to a court or tribunal in accordance with leave granted under subsection (1) in relation to particular proceedings, the document or information must not be adduced in other proceedings before the court or tribunal except:  (c) in accordance with leave granted under subsection (1) in relation to the other proceedings; or  (d) as a result of an exercise of power under subsection (4) in relation to the other proceedings.  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If:  (a) a document is produced; or  (b) information is disclosed; to a court or tribunal in accordance with leave granted under subsection (1) in relation to particular proceedings, the document or information must not be adduced in other proceedings before the court or tribunal except:  (c) in accordance with leave granted under subsection (1) in relation to the other proceedings; or  (d) as a result of an exercise of power under subsection (4) in relation to the other proceedings.  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "657078528e8215f07fb7b2f76af04453b5c2fadc03582f2c2f870211ff411008" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157b ;
