concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-157c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "157C Disclosure of protected cartel information to a party to court"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-157c ;
    values:originalText "proceedings etc. Commission or Commission official not required to make discovery of documents containing protected cartel information etc.  (1) If:  (a) a person is a party to proceedings before a court; and  (b) the Commission is not a party to the proceedings; the Commission or a Commission official is not to be required, in connection with the proceedings, to:  (c) make discovery (however described) to the person of a document containing protected cartel information; or  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "proceedings etc. Commission or Commission official not required to make discovery of documents containing protected cartel information etc.  (1) If:  (a) a person is a party to proceedings before a court; and  (b) the Commission is not a party to the proceedings; the Commission or a Commission official is not to be required, in connection with the proceedings, to:  (c) make discovery (however described) to the person of a document containing protected cartel information; or  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d31f2feb469e5292afda54b7bbbf9b7a06bb725ddfee743d8ee3c9be42b7de92" ;
    cof:pageNumber "561"^^xsd:integer ;
