concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-163 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "163 Prosecutions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-163 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Prosecutions for offences against this Act may be brought in any court having jurisdiction in the matter.  (2) In so far as this section has effect as a law of the Commonwealth, the Federal Court has jurisdiction in any matter in respect of which a criminal proceeding is instituted for an offence to which subsection (1) applies, and that jurisdiction is exclusive of the jurisdiction of any other court other than:  (a) the jurisdiction of a Supreme Court of a State or Territory under section 68 of the Judiciary Act 1903 with respect to any matter in respect of which a criminal proceeding is instituted for an offence against section 45AF or 45AG or subsection 56BN(1) or 56BZI(1); and  (b) the jurisdiction of a court under section 68 of the Judiciary Act 1903 with respect to the examination and commitment  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Prosecutions for offences against this Act may be brought in any court having jurisdiction in the matter.  (2) In so far as this section has effect as a law of the Commonwealth, the Federal Court has jurisdiction in any matter in respect of which a criminal proceeding is instituted for an offence to which subsection (1) applies, and that jurisdiction is exclusive of the jurisdiction of any other court other than:  (a) the jurisdiction of a Supreme Court of a State or Territory under section 68 of the Judiciary Act 1903 with respect to any matter in respect of which a criminal proceeding is instituted for an offence against section 45AF or 45AG or subsection 56BN(1) or 56BZI(1); and  (b) the jurisdiction of a court under section 68 of the Judiciary Act 1903 with respect to the examination and commitment  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "573da90ff790966db29e116ffd91a596bbe8e2fd79c1061efd5d562d78bd24af" ;
    cof:pageNumber "571"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-163-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-163-ss-2 ;
