concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-170 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "170 Legal and financial assistance"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-170 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person:  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Miscellaneous  Part XII  Section 170  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (a) who has instituted, or proposes to institute, a proceeding before the Commission or the Tribunal, or a proceeding before the Court under Part IVB, Part VI or section 163A, or under Part 3-5 or Chapter 5 of the Australian Consumer Law;  (b) who is entitled to participate, or has been permitted to intervene, in a proceeding before the Commission or the Tribunal; or  (c) against whom a proceeding before the Court has been instituted under Part IVB, Part VI or section 163A, or under" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person:  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Miscellaneous  Part XII  Section 170  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (a) who has instituted, or proposes to institute, a proceeding before the Commission or the Tribunal, or a proceeding before the Court under Part IVB, Part VI or section 163A, or under Part 3-5 or Chapter 5 of the Australian Consumer Law;  (b) who is entitled to participate, or has been permitted to intervene, in a proceeding before the Commission or the Tribunal; or  (c) against whom a proceeding before the Court has been instituted under Part IVB, Part VI or section 163A, or under"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8745fd6aa995aa260e321ba6a54114d395ca10d1935e47d7d735f6897982ff9c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "578"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Entitlement to participate in proceedings before Commission or Tribunal" ;
