doc:sec-171a-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "171A(2) Charges by the Commission" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Where:  (a) the Commission provides a discretionary service for a person; and  (b) this Act does not otherwise provide for a charge for the service; the Commission may make a charge of such amount, or at such a rate, as is agreed between the Commission and the person." ;
