concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-171b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "171B Division 3 of Part IIIA does not confer judicial power on the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-171b ;
    values:originalText "Commission  (1) Division 3 of Part IIIA has no effect to the extent (if any) to which it purports to confer judicial power on the Commission.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Miscellaneous  Part XII  Section 172  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) In this section: judicial power means the judicial power of the Commonwealth referred to in section 71 of the Constitution." ;
    skos:definition "Commission  (1) Division 3 of Part IIIA has no effect to the extent (if any) to which it purports to confer judicial power on the Commission.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Miscellaneous  Part XII  Section 172  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  (2) In this section: judicial power means the judicial power of the Commonwealth referred to in section 71 of the Constitution."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3d41e1a66a7daeb8da761812e830ca56fe19dd3ec7c8e2e6b0ca2abeef1a2010" ;
    cof:pageNumber "582"^^xsd:integer ;
