    values:originalText "in existence before that time  The following provisions of this Act:  (a) paragraph 88(1A)(b);  (b) paragraph 93AB(1A)(c);  (c) paragraph 93AB(1A)(d); apply in relation to a contract or arrangement made, or an understanding arrived at, before, at or after the commencement time." ;
    cof:pageNumber "586"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-176 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "176 Proceedings relating to price-fixing contraventions taking place"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-176 ;
    values:originalText "before the commencement time  Despite the repeal of section 76D by the Trade Practices Amendment (Cartel Conduct and Other Measures) Act 2009, that section continues to apply, in relation to proceedings (whether instituted before or after the commencement time) in relation to a  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Application and transitional provisions relating to the competition provisions  Part XIII Cartel conduct  Division 1  Section 177  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  contravention that took place before the commencement time, as if that repeal had not happened." ;
    skos:definition "before the commencement time  Despite the repeal of section 76D by the Trade Practices Amendment (Cartel Conduct and Other Measures) Act 2009, that section continues to apply, in relation to proceedings (whether instituted before or after the commencement time) in relation to a  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Application and transitional provisions relating to the competition provisions  Part XIII Cartel conduct  Division 1  Section 177  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026  contravention that took place before the commencement time, as if that repeal had not happened."@en ;
