concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-184 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "184 Notices under section 93"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-184 ;
    values:originalText "A notice that was in force under a provision of section 93 immediately before the commencement time continues in force (and may be dealt with) at and after the commencement time as if it had been given under that provision as amended by the amending Act.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Application and transitional provisions relating to the competition provisions  Part XIII Application of amendments made by the Competition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review) Act 2017  Division 3  Section 185  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
    skos:definition "A notice that was in force under a provision of section 93 immediately before the commencement time continues in force (and may be dealt with) at and after the commencement time as if it had been given under that provision as amended by the amending Act.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Application and transitional provisions relating to the competition provisions  Part XIII Application of amendments made by the Competition and Consumer Amendment (Competition Policy Review) Act 2017  Division 3  Section 185  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7aece7d4eabd18a45a1b7369eff0434eb330107b7228a5b65a3ea9c63b81f7df" ;
