    skos:definition "(3) Despite the repeal of Subdivisions A and C of Division 3 of Part VII by Schedule 9 to the amending Act, those Subdivisions (other than sections 95AZ, 95AZA, 95AZL and 95AZM) continue to apply at and after the commencement time, as if the repeal had not happened, in relation to an application:  (a) made under section 95AU before the commencement time; and  Chapter 8  Miscellaneous"@en ;
