concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-191 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "191 Amendments of section 50"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-191 ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by Division 1 of Part 3 of Schedule 1 to the Treasury Laws Amendment (Mergers and Acquisitions Reform) Act 2024 apply in relation to an acquisition that is put into effect on or after 1 January 2026, other than an acquisition to which subsection 189(2) of this Act applies." ;
    skos:definition "The amendments made by Division 1 of Part 3 of Schedule 1 to the Treasury Laws Amendment (Mergers and Acquisitions Reform) Act 2024 apply in relation to an acquisition that is put into effect on or after 1 January 2026, other than an acquisition to which subsection 189(2) of this Act applies."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "04b55abadd066a53fc96464998dfdb36772e57947e1d26180664180174591fa4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "600"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Amendments apply to acquisitions put into effect after 1 January 2026, with an exception for certain acquisitions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.600" ;
    cml:asserts concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-191-norm .
concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-191-norm a values:Undertaking ;
    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-191 ;
    values:deonticStatus values:HeuristicDerived ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sec-191 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "191 Amendments of section 50" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by Division 1 of Part 3 of Schedule 1 to the Treasury Laws Amendment (Mergers and Acquisitions Reform) Act 2024 apply in relation to an acquisition that is put into effect on or after 1 January 2026, other than an acquisition to which subsection 189(2) of this Act applies." ;
    cof:pageNumber "600"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-192 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "192 Acquisition of property"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-192 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendments made by Schedule 1 to the Treasury Laws Amendment (Mergers and Acquisitions Reform) Act 2024 do not apply in relation to an acquisition if:  (a) apart from this section, the operation of the amendments in relation to the acquisition would result in an acquisition of property from a person otherwise than on just terms; and  (b) the acquisition of property would be invalid because of paragraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution.  (2) In this section: acquisition of property has the same meaning as in paragraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution. just terms has the same meaning as in paragraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Application and transitional provisions relating to the competition provisions  Part XIII Application of amendments made by the Treasury Laws Amendment (Doubling Penalties for ACCC Enforcement) Act 2026  Division 7  Section 193  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The amendments made by Schedule 1 to the Treasury Laws Amendment (Mergers and Acquisitions Reform) Act 2024 do not apply in relation to an acquisition if:  (a) apart from this section, the operation of the amendments in relation to the acquisition would result in an acquisition of property from a person otherwise than on just terms; and  (b) the acquisition of property would be invalid because of paragraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution.  (2) In this section: acquisition of property has the same meaning as in paragraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution. just terms has the same meaning as in paragraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution.  Miscellaneous  Chapter 8 Application and transitional provisions relating to the competition provisions  Part XIII Application of amendments made by the Treasury Laws Amendment (Doubling Penalties for ACCC Enforcement) Act 2026  Division 7  Section 193  Competition and Consumer Act 2010  Compilation date: 27/05/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1e8934fb92ac6ef7547380e980933ec5c16283b5409bd443d5038809db05422c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "600"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-192-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-192-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.600" .
